      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2997701947782708253, guid: e16bce84171832e45a02c038e842c326, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Ooh! A stack of papers! Let's see. . . it's got a bunch of numbers on
        it. . . is the stack of receipts Mr. S was looking for? They were right here
        this whole time! I'd better return it to him.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2997701947782708253, guid: e16bce84171832e45a02c038e842c326, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: The top receipt is a little wrinkled, and is stained with chocolate.
        Let's see. . . two pairs of black gloves and hats? A flashlight? AND some
        candy bars? This looks like something the thief would have bought! Or, no!
        There's more than one thief!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2997701947782708253, guid: e16bce84171832e45a02c038e842c326, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Wait a minute! There's something else here!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2997701947782708253, guid: e16bce84171832e45a02c038e842c326, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: I already have the stack of receipts. I should return it to Mr. S.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2997701947782708253, guid: e16bce84171832e45a02c038e842c326, type: 3}
